The CLI's non-mesh runtime artifacts (index sqlite + WAL/SHM/journal sidecars, the refresh lock, the perf log) share the .wiki/ namespace with the mesh store. store.rs#is_runtime_artifact must enumerate exactly the filenames the writers (index/mod.rs sqlite, lock.rs refresh lock, perf.rs log) emit, or the mesh reader fails closed parsing one as a mesh; .gitignore must ignore the same set. Adding or renaming an artifact at any writer requires updating the exclusion list and .gitignore in lockstep.
